{"id":"en_the-unbreakables-super-son-returns","title":"The Unbreakables: Super Son Returns","titleEn":"The Unbreakables: Super Son Returns","description":"Kit disappears at seven during a robot attack and is taken in by his abductor Voltage, who raises him under the name Ash. Years later, Ash enters his own family’s tryouts, where Spark—Voltage’s son—frames him. His birthmark almost gives him away, Aura grows suspicious through intuition, and their father remains doubtful until Spark burns the mark off. Once Voltage publicly declares Ash his, the family is plunged into conflict. Ash demonstrates his true lineage and aids their escape. At the crater his memories return, and he takes back the name Kit Unbreakable, though Spark’s betrayal is left unsettled.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-unbreakables-super-son-returns/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-unbreakables-super-son-returns/en_US/4fe59afea2519298/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Male","Mistaken Identity","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dij6a/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-unbreakables-super-son-returns_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dij6a/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-unbreakables-super-son-returns_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dij6a/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-unbreakables-super-son-returns_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dij6a/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-unbreakables-super-son